combinationalweightingcloudmodel
WANGJianbo1,2,HUANG Wenjing1,QIN Na1,ZHANG Wei1
(1.SchoolofManagementEngineering,QingdaoUniversityofTechnology,Qingdao266525,China;
2.UniversityResearchCenterforSmartCityConstructionand ManagementofShandongProvince,Qingdao266525,China)
Abstract:Inordertoensuretheobjectivityoftheriskevaluationofsubwayshieldconstruc
tion,thispaperbuildsamodeloftheriskevaluationofsubwayshieldconstructionbasedon
thecombinationalweightingcloudmodel.Firstly,throughliteratureresearchandconsulting
experts,aqualifiedriskevaluationindexsystemforsubwayshieldconstructionisestablished
fromtheperspectivesofman,machine,technologyandenvironment.Secondly,considering
thelimitationandone-sidednessofsingleindex weighting,theevaluationindexisweighted
bycombiningthe G1 method (orderrelationanalysis method)andthe COWA operator
game.Atthesametime,inordertosolvethefuzzinessandrandomnessintheevaluationof
constructionrisk,theevaluationcloudmapisdrawnbythecloudmodeltoevaluatethesub
wayshieldconstructionrisk.Finally,takingtheAn’anSectionofQingdao MetroLine1as
anexample,thisstudydrawsthecomprehensiveevaluationcloud mapoftheoverallcon
structionriskoftheprojectbyusing MATLAB,andtheconstructionrisklevelishereby
confirmedtobelow,whichisconsistentwiththeactualmonitoringresultsoftheproject,


